0.7027 → **+42.5% relative improvement**), test R² = **+0.5649**.

Best LOSO-CV model = **RandomForest** with MAE = **0.4273** (LOSO NULL
0.7794 → **+45.2% relative improvement**), LOSO-CV R² = **+0.6591**.

