- `ml_beats_null_loso_cv` — **PASSED** (+22.02 K, +30.1%)
- `ml_beats_push_25_physics_ridge_baseline` — **PASSED** (+19.18 K, +27.2%)
- `positive_test_r2_holdout` — **PASSED** (+0.0011)
- `positive_loso_cv_r2` — **PASSED** (+0.4049)
